ithin 14 days of paralysis onset and received in the laboratory in acceptable condition.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"although population denominators for southern Sudan are uncertain\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}